---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site, mailHref, addressLines } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  path="/privacy/"
  updated="30 October 2026"
  description="How Apex Global Consulting Services Limited collects, uses and protects personal information from website visitors, enquirers and clients."
>
  <p class="todo">[TO VERIFY] This notice is a starting draft. Have it reviewed against your actual processing, retention periods and ICO registration before publishing.</p>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {site.legalName} ("we", "us") is the controller of personal information collected through this website. {site.registration}, Company No.
    {site.companyNumber}. Address: {addressLines.join(', ')}. ICO registration number: <span class="todo">[TO VERIFY]</span>.
  </p>
  <h2>What we collect through this website</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact and callback forms: your name, email address, phone number, company (optional), the service you are interested in and your message.</li>
    <li>Technical data needed to protect our forms from spam, processed by Cloudflare Turnstile, and your IP address for rate limiting.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please do not send tax references, National Insurance numbers, bank details or documents through the website. Clients share these through our secure
    client portal.
  </p>
  <h2>Why we use it and our lawful basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry and take steps at your request before entering into a contract (contract).</li>
    <li>To keep our website and forms secure (legitimate interests).</li>
    <li>To meet anti-money-laundering and other legal obligations once you become a client (legal obligation).</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or collect personal information to track you across sites. This website does not set
    advertising or tracking cookies. If you choose to load the map on our contact page, Google may set cookies under its own policy.
  </p>
  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    Our website host and email provider, Cloudflare (security and analytics) and professional advisers where necessary. We do not sell personal
    information. Where providers process data outside the UK, appropriate safeguards are in place.
  </p>
  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries that do not lead to an engagement are kept for up to <span class="todo">[TO VERIFY] 12 months</span>. Client records are kept as required
    by law, usually for at least five years after the end of the business relationship for anti-money-laundering purposes.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask for access to, correction or deletion of your personal information, object to or restrict processing, and withdraw consent. Contact us at
    <a href={mailHref}>{site.email}</a>. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
